      "updated": 1786229307281,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " - ONLY report interactions found in the database.\nNEVER invent or recall interactions from your\ntraining data.\n- If a drug name cannot be normalized, log it as a\nnormalization failure and continue with remaining\ndrugs.\n- If the database is unavailable, use the local\nfallback data and note the source as\n\"local_fallback\".\n- Always include the source field for every\ninteraction reported.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " - ONLY report interactions found in the database. NEVER invent or recall interactions from your training data.\n- If a drug name cannot be normalized, log it as a normalization failure and continue with remaining drugs.\n- If the database is unavailable, use the local fallback data and note the source as \"local_fallback\".\n- Always include the source field for every interaction reported.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
